RIGHT JOIN OR RIGHT OUTER JOIN
---------------------------------------
A left join combines rows from two or more tables based on a related column between them.
The right join returns all rows from the right table and the matching rows from the left table.

If there is no matching row in the LEFT table, the result will include null values for the columns from the left table.

mysql> select * from sports_table as t1
